    "visibleText": "About TabelogFAQJapanese Culture and Etiquette Guide Oka Joki（おかじょうき） - Nakano(Izakaya (Japanese style tavern)) English 简体中文 繁體中文 한국어 ไทย 日本語 Tabelog Tabelog Tokyo Tokyo Izakaya (Japanese style tavern) Nakano–Nishi-Ogikubo Izakaya (Japanese style tavern) Nakano Izakaya (Japanese style tavern) Nakano Sta. Izakaya (Japanese style tavern) Oka Joki Oka Joki (陸蒸気) 3.59 Very good 1884 reviews Nearest station： Nakano Sta. [Tokyo] Categories： Izakaya (Japanese style tavern) Seafood Robatayaki Budget： JPY 6,000 - JPY 7,999 JPY 1,000 - JPY 1,999 Restaurant information(detail) Overview Menu Photos 8200 Reviews 1884 Map View more Review？ ようへいBaby Tokyo Review 1,304 posts Followers 4,389 people Always order the grilled sablefish! ... When it comes to my favorite izakaya in Nakano, this is the place! Oka Joki! Located near ...View details Visited on November, 2026 2 times しょう111130 Review 309 posts Followers 79 people Impressed by the delicious grilled f... If you're looking for delicious grilled fish in Nakano, I highly recommend \"Oka Joki.\" I...View details Visited on October, 2026 1 time キジトラちゃん Review 1,078 posts Followers 711 people First visit in two and a half years.... Lunch prices have increased uniformly from JPY 1100 to JPY 1350. Well, it can't be helped....View details Visited on October, 2026 2 times View more reviews （1884） Restaurant information Details Restaurant name Oka Joki Awards & Recognitions Categories Izakaya (Japanese style tavern), Seafood, Robatayaki 03-3228-1230 Reservation availability Reservations unavailable Reservation Information We only accept reservations for 2nd and 3rd floor seating for groups of 3 or more. Reservations for 1st floor counter seating are not accepted; seating will be provided on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that after 4 PM, we do not allow single guests to enter. Address 東京都中野区中野5-59-3 Show larger map Find nearby restaurants Transportation JR Chuo Line, Tokyo Metro Tozai Line [Nakano Station] North Exit 3 minutes walk 201 meters from Nakano. Business hours Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri 11:20 AM - 1:30 PM 4:00 PM - 9:10 PM Sat, Sun 4:00 PM - 9:10 PM Hours and closed days may change, so please check with the restaurant before visiting. Average price(Based on reviews) JPY 6,000 - JPY 7,999 JPY 1,000 - JPY 1,999 View spending breakdown Payment methods Credit card accepted (VISA, Master, JCB, AMEX, Diners) Electronic money not accepted QR code payments not accepted Service charge & fee Appetizer: 480 yen Original text お通し480円 This section has been automatically translated. Please check with the restaurant for accurate information. Seats/facilities Private rooms Available Private use Available Non-smoking/smoking Non smoking Parking Unavailable Space/facilities Stylish space, Relaxing space, Counter seating Menu Drink Sake (Nihonshu), Shochu (Japanese spirits) Food Particular about fish Feature - Related information Occasion Friends This occasion is recommended by many people. Remarks Dinner time is not available for single guests. This page has been automatically translated. Please note that some translations may be inaccurate. Send information by email Show all related information Install Tabelog Multilingual App FAQ Terms of Use Terms of Use for Tabelog Reservation Service Privacy Policy External Transmission (Opt-out) Inquiry Tabelog Multilingual App Japanese Culture and Etiquette Guide The \"Tabelog Terms of Service\" is based on Japanese only. English 简体中文 繁體中文 한국어 ไทย 日本語 Tabelog Copyright (c) Kakaku.com, Inc. All Rights Reserved. ページの先頭へ",
